# Git Attributes — 云顶编码规范工程约定
# 文本文件统一按 UTF-8（无 BOM）存储，行尾由 core.autocrlf 按平台转换。
# 二进制资源显式声明，防止 diff/合并损坏。

* text=auto

# 二进制资源
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.map binary
*.pdf binary
